## Model weights

OmniParser model weights distributed by Microsoft on the Hugging Face Hub
(`microsoft/OmniParser`, `microsoft/OmniParser-v2.0`) are NOT redistributed
by this repository. They are downloaded by end users at runtime via the
`huggingface_hub` client. Those weights carry their own licenses, including
provisions inherited from upstream model families (notably AGPL-3.0 for the
YOLO-derived `icon_detect` weights). See `WEIGHTS_LICENSE.md` for downstream
implications.

## Third-party components

This repository's runtime dependencies are declared per package in each
`pyproject.toml`. A consolidated SBOM is produced on every release and
attached as a build artifact (CycloneDX format).
